# Signup and billing

Get Started uses `/sign-up` from `lib/signup-handoff.ts` when sign-up is enabled. Ratings and snapshots stay in the app. iOS does not start checkout.

`POST /billing/checkout` runs only when `BILLING_PROVIDER=endpoint`. Production must reject `sandbox`. Admin user records and payments show account email, rating stats, and invoices. Do not render database URLs, password hashes, or mail API keys.
